# LangChain RAG Architecture

An AI-powered Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) application built using LangChain, ChromaDB, Google Gemini, and Streamlit.

## Features
- Upload and process PowerPoint presentations.
- Extract and split document content into chunks.
- Generate embeddings using Google Gemini.
- Store and retrieve information using ChromaDB.
- Answer questions using an LLM with relevant retrieved context.
- Display AI-generated answers through a Streamlit interface.

## Technologies
- Python
- LangChain
- ChromaDB
- Google Gemini
- Streamlit
- python-pptx

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/roudyd33/langchain-rag-architecture.git
cd langchain-rag-architecture
pip install -r requirements.txt
